@startuml authorized-request
title Authorized request: nurse reads patient 1's record
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Nurse
participant BasicAuthenticationFilter as Basic
participant ExceptionTranslationFilter as Exceptions
participant AuthorizationFilter as URL
participant "Method security\n@PreAuthorize" as Method
participant OwnRecordGuard as Guard
participant PatientController as Controller
participant ClinicRepository as Repository
Nurse -> Basic : GET /api/patients/1/record\nvalid Basic credentials
Basic -> Basic : authenticate and set SecurityContext
Basic -> Exceptions : chain.doFilter
Exceptions -> URL : chain.doFilter
note right of URL
  AccessPolicy generates rules from AccessRules.
  PATIENT or NURSE; hierarchy admits DOCTOR and ADMIN.
end note
URL -> Method : role rule passes
Method -> Guard : allows(authentication, 1)
Guard --> Method : true (caller is staff)
Method -> Controller : record(1)
Controller -> Repository : record(1)
Repository --> Controller : MedicalRecord
Controller --> Nurse : 200 OK + record
note over Controller, Repository
  Completed service behavior requires slice 3.
end note
@enduml
